@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
hide empty description

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Open1 : starts.due
Open1 --> Water1 : age >= 2s
Water1 --> Stop1 : age >= 5min
Stop1 --> Idle : age >= 2s

Idle : válvula apagada, bomba apagada
Open1 : válvula encendida, bomba apagada
Water1 : válvula encendida, bomba encendida
Stop1 : válvula encendida, bomba apagada
@enduml
